 vas commencer par **2 répétitions de 1'** à VMA avec 1' de récupération puis **4 répétitions de 2'** toujours avec 1' de récupération. ","displayName":"Séance S30 alternative : \"Coup de bélier\"","coachAdvice":"On commence avec quelques intervalles à  VMA aujourd'hui ce qui permet, en plus d'un petit rappel, de créer un contraste ensuite avec le S30. Essaie mentalement d'utiliser ce contraste à ton avantage pour trouver le S30 \"facile\" et gagner en efficacité gestuelle, au lieu de trouver ça intense et désagréable.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"VMA_1","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VMA","value":211,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":false,"slug":"vma"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":242,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation