ète, mais c'est important !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S30_600_4","description":"Séance de seuil 30' où tu vas enchaîner **4 répétitions de 3'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 2' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 30","coachAdvice":"On commence à aborder les choses sérieuses. Reste concentré(e) pendant tes intervalles d'allures. Attention à ta posture, à ton gainage et à ton souffle afin de rester efficace. Avec la fatigue, tu vas vouloir te relâcher : grosse erreur.","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":242,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":596,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLa