t":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"À partir de là, tu devrais commencer à voir une amélioration au niveau de ton aisance à courir à cette allure non ? L'endurance fondamentale, c'est une allure extrêmement efficace pour développer ton système cardio-respiratoire. Ses effets commencent à se sentir au bout de quelques semaines seulement donc tu devrais commencer à le sentir ! Sinon, ne perds pas espoir, au contraire, persévère à bien respecter l'allure, ce processus est plus rapide pour certains que d'autres ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.017543859649122,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_65_HARD_2","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 2 séries de 10' Tempo, séparées par 2' de repos.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"En augmentant très progressivement la durée de la sortie longues, petit à petit, on fait tout pour t'éviter les blessures et te garantir une belle évolution dans les mois qui viennent !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_30","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_10","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":299,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":596,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_11","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":11,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1789344000000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a830a50a5465acfb3ed4830","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1789344000000,"sessionIndex":5,"choRecommendation":3,"formSuggestions":["semi-liquid","liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"fV5sxS6dTOmJgqP6qnmqoA","name":"Velouté de tomates spécial effort","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":800,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":48,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"value":3280,"metric":"mg"}}}],[{"datoId":"UMD5Rt1ESQ25KBXonqCm0A","name":"Jus de pomme","form":"liquid","info":{"quantity":{"value":440,"metric":"mL"},"waterQuantity":{"value":360,"metric":"mL"},"cho":{"value":48.4,"metric":"g"},"sodium":{"v